OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and two injured in
OL,4,Amotorway crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and two people have been
OL,7,Finjured in a motorway crash.
OL,9,FDurham Police said three cars were
OL,10,Finvolved in the collision on the A1(M)
OL,11,Fsouthbound between junctions 57 and 58
OL,12,Fnear Darlington, at about 11:40 BST.
OL,14,FA man in his 60s, who was the driver of
OL,15,Fa Vauxhall Mokka, was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fat the scene, the force said.
OL,18,FIt added the road remains closed as
OL,19,Fcollision investigators work at the
OL,20,Fscene.
